  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We will provide immediate food and home essential support to 300 families affected by Tropical Storm Megi in 3 bady-hit villages in Baybay City, Leyte as well as in 1 village in Albuera Municipality where we are based. The massive landslide has caused widespread destruction and the need for support to affected families in urgent and important.</narrative>
